<fn-group>
  <fn id="fn1">
    <label>1</label><p>Convex-solver-based methods use CLARABEL
    (<xref alt="Goulart &amp; Chen, 2024" rid="ref-clarabel" ref-type="bibr">Goulart
    &amp; Chen, 2024</xref>), an interior point method that employs
    heuristics which make it difficult to tightly bound analytically,
    although in practice it converges in 10–50 steps.</p>
  </fn>
</fn-group>
